imited resources like Nepal. This paper explores the current state of e-governance practices in Nepal from the local governance perspective, identifies key opportunities and challenges, and proposes strategic measures for effective and inclusive implementation. © 2026 Reg Bahadur Bhandari, Nirav Bhatta, Gajendra Sharma and Youba Raj Poudyal. This open-access article is distributed under a Creative Commons Attribution (CC-BY) 4.0 license.},
