es of AI governance, and implementing joint coordination platforms of intelligence-cybersecurity. All this will improve the level of transparency, adaptability, and resilience of national security systems and promote global action for a secure digital environment. Copyright © 2025 The Authors. This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International License.https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/},
