utoencoders achieved top accuracy (91.61%) in detecting IoMT cyberattacks. Model Comparisons: XGBoost, Random Forest, and SVM showed great strength in intrusion detection. AI in IoMT Security: Emphasizing the integration of deep learning to evolve IoMT cybersecurity and patient safety. © The Author(s) 2025.},
